    -- ko_other_coverage_whole_year: hsa.ko_other_coverage_whole_year
    -- ko_earnings_on_excess_contributions: hsa.ko_earnings_on_excess_contributions
    -- ko_hsa_testing_period_additional_income_yes: hsa.ko_hsa_testing_period_additional_income_yes
    -- ko_hsa_unqualified_distributions: hsa.ko_hsa_unqualified_distributions
    -- ko_hsa_distribution_fmv: hsa.ko_hsa_distribution_fmv
    -- ko_marital_change_affects_contribution_limit: hsa.ko_marital_change_affects_contribution_limit
    -- ko_mfs_line6_check: hsa.ko_mfs_line6_check
    -- ko_hsa_contributions_over_limit: hsa.ko_hsa_contributions_over_limit
    -- ko_hsa_excess_contributions: hsa.ko_hsa_excess_contributions
    -- ko_contribution_summary_none_allowed: hsa.ko_contribution_summary_none_allowed
    -- ko_hdhp_coverage_status_not_needed: hsa.ko_hdhp_coverage_status_not_needed
    -- ko_not_enrolled_in_hdhp: hsa.ko_not_enrolled_in_hdhp
    -- ko_made_qualified_hsa_funding_distribution: hsa.ko_made_qualified_hsa_funding_distribution
    -- ko_hsa_coverage: hsa.ko_hsa_coverage
    -- ko_filer_is_dependent_and_contributes_to_hsa: hsa.ko_filer_is_dependent_and_contributes_to_hsa
    -- ko_has_hsa_distributions_without_activity: hsa.ko_has_hsa_distributions_without_activity
    -- ko_hsa_distributions_secondary_filer_used_without_mfj: hsa.ko_hsa_distributions_secondary_filer_used_without_mfj
  }
```

## Knockouts defined here

### `income.xml`: unsupported income sources, digital assets, foreign accounts, IRA contributions

`flow.xml` lines 106 to 111: `Not(/incomeSourcesSupported)`, `Not(/notDigitalAssets)`,
`/hasForeignAccountsOrTrusts`, `/madeIraContributions`. The questionnaire asks
whether Direct File supports all the income sources (an answer of "no" knocks
out); whether the taxpayer received or disposed of a digital asset (Form 1040
page 1 question); whether the taxpayer has an interest in or signature
authority over a foreign account or a foreign trust (FinCEN 114, Form 3520);
and whether the taxpayer made IRA contributions (Form 8606, Schedule 1 line 20).
All four DF facts are Writable Booleans or Any/Not over them, and all four
oracle values are constant (`/incomeSourcesSupported` true, the others false).

### `formW2s.xml`: state facts

The four members of `flow.xml` lines 34 to 40 that depend on W-2 boxes 14 and 15:
income from a state other than the supported ones, a box 14 NY RRTA code Direct
File knocks out, RRTA codes in box 14 when the filer did not live in New York,
and Yonkers taxes with a part-year Yonkers resident. The W-2 boxes themselves
are state-return data the formalization does not carry; the derived conditions
are inputs, and the rules are the DF ones.

### `filers.xml`: unsupported state

`/flowKnockoutUnsupportedState` is `Not(/hasIncomeInScope)`. Direct File
supports the filers who lived and earned income in exactly one of the states of
`/scopedStateOptions` (`constants.xml` lines 327 to 360). `catala/filers.catala_en`
leaves this fact to this issue (its header and the comment before
`Filers.unsupported`). The DF enums `primaryFilerW2And1099IntStateOptions` and
`spouseScopedStateOptions` are reduced to the three tests the rule makes.

### `flow.xml`: too late to file, no payments or credits

`/isTooLateToFileOrResubmit` is `Any(isAfterTaxDayAndNotResubmitting,
isAfterResubmissionDeadline)`. `/knockoutHasNoPaymentsOrCredits`
(`taxCalculations.xml`) is computed by Form1040
(`Form1040.ko_knockout_has_no_payments_or_credits`) and enters here as an input;
the same value feeds `Hsa` (`ko_no_payments_hsa_distribution`).

```catala
scope KnockoutsIncome:
  definition local_knockouts equals LocalKnockouts {
    -- ko_income_sources_not_supported: not income_sources_supported
    -- ko_not_digital_assets: received_digital_assets or disposed_digital_assets
    -- ko_has_foreign_accounts_or_trusts: has_foreign_accounts_or_trusts
    -- ko_made_ira_contributions: made_ira_contributions
    -- ko_flow_knockout_box15_income_from_different_state: w2_box15_income_from_different_state
    -- ko_has_a_box14_nyrrta_value_we_knockout: w2_has_box14_nyrrta_knockout_code
    -- ko_flow_knockout_has_rrta_codes_in_box14_not_in_ny: w2_has_rrta_codes_in_box14 and not lived_in_ny
    -- ko_knockout_yonkers_part_year: w2_paid_yonkers_taxes and part_year_yonkers_resident
    -- ko_flow_knockout_unsupported_state: not has_income_in_scope
    -- ko_is_too_late_to_file_or_resubmit: is_after_tax_day_and_not_resubmitting or is_after_resubmission_deadline
    -- ko_knockout_has_no_payments_or_credits: knockout_has_no_payments_or_credits
  }
```

## Aggregation

`unsupported_income_or_hsa` is the disjunction of the per-module `unsupported`
flags and of the knockouts defined here. `fired_knockouts` lists the reasons
(`KnockoutReason`) behind it; a test checks that the list is empty exactly when
`unsupported_income_or_hsa` is false.

```catala
scope KnockoutsIncome:
  definition unsupported_interest equals interest.unsupported
  definition unsupported_w2s equals w2.unsupported
  definition unsupported_unemployment equals unemp.unsupported
  definition unsupported_misc equals misc.unsupported
  definition unsupported_rs equals rs.unsupported
  definition unsupported_ss equals ss.repayment_over_3k
  definition unsupported_ep equals ep.unsupported
  definition unsupported_hsa equals hsa.unsupported
  definition unsupported_local equals
    local_knockouts.ko_income_sources_not_supported
    or local_knockouts.ko_not_digital_assets
    or local_knockouts.ko_has_foreign_accounts_or_trusts
    or local_knockouts.ko_made_ira_contributions
    or local_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_box15_income_from_different_state
    or local_knockouts.ko_has_a_box14_nyrrta_value_we_knockout
    or local_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_has_rrta_codes_in_box14_not_in_ny
    or local_knockouts.ko_knockout_yonkers_part_year
    or local_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_unsupported_state
    or local_knockouts.ko_is_too_late_to_file_or_resubmit
    or local_knockouts.ko_knockout_has_no_payments_or_credits
  definition unsupported_income_or_hsa equals
    unsupported_interest
    or unsupported_w2s
    or unsupported_unemployment
    or unsupported_misc
    or unsupported_rs
    or unsupported_ss
    or unsupported_ep
    or unsupported_hsa
    or unsupported_local

  definition knockout_table equals [
      KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.HasRequiredFactaFilings -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_has_required_facta_filings }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHasEarlyWithdrawlPenalty -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_has_early_withdrawl_penalty }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHasBonds -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_has_bonds }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHasForeignTaxPaid -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_has_foreign_tax_paid }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutWithholdingUnsupportedState -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_withholding_unsupported_state }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutStateTaxWithheld -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_state_tax_withheld }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.HasInterestIncomeAndAgiAboveThresholdForMfs -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_has_interest_income_and_agi_above_threshold_for_mfs }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.HasInterestIncomeAndAgiAboveThresholdForMfjOrQss -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_has_interest_income_and_agi_above_threshold_for_mfj_or_qss }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.HasInterestIncomeAndAgiAboveThresholdForSingleOrHoh -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_has_interest_income_and_agi_above_threshold_for_single_or_hoh }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutTaxExemptInterest -- fired: interest_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_tax_exempt_interest }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutForBox12Value -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_knockout_for_box12_value }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutForBox12Dependency -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_knockout_for_box12_dependency }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutAllocatedTips -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_allocated_tips }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutStatutoryEmployee -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_statutory_employee }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutThirdPartySickPay -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_third_party_sick_pay }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutNonQualifiedPlans -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_non_qualified_plans }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutMedicareWages -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_knockout_medicare_wages }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.AnyFilerExceedsMaxOasdiWages -- fired: form_w2_knockouts.ko_any_filer_exceeds_max_oasdi_wages }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockout1099GRepayTooHigh -- fired: unemployment_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout1099_g_repay_too_high }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutUnemploymentCompensationUnsupportedState -- fired: unemployment_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_unemployment_compensation_unsupported_state }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.ExtraNonPfd1099Misc -- fired: form1099_misc_knockouts.ko_non_pfd_1099_misc }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementTaxableAmountNotDetermined -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_taxable_amount_not_determined }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementTaxableAmountBlank -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_taxable_amount_blank }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementTotalDistribution -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_total_distribution }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutForForm1099RBox8Value -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_for_form1099_r_box8_value }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutForForm1099RBox8Percentage -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_for_form1099_r_box8_percentage }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutForForm1099RBox9aPercentage -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_for_form1099_r_box9a_percentage }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementCapitalGain -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_capital_gain }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementNetUnrealizedAppreciation -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_net_unrealized_appreciation }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementAmountAllocableToIRR -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_amount_allocable_to_irr }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementFactaFilingRequirement -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_facta_filing_requirement }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutForRollover -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_for_rollover }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutForDeathBenefitPaymentDate -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_for_death_benefit_payment_date }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementQualifiedDisasterDistribution -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_qualified_disaster_distribution }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutRetirementPublicSafetyOfficer -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_public_safety_officer }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutForPreTaxToPostTaxRollover -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_for_pre_tax_to_post_tax_rollover }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutBox15 -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_box15 }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutForForm1099RDistributionCode -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_for_form1099_r_distribution_code }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutIraSepSimple -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_ira_sep_simple }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutTaxablePensionRollover -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_taxable_pension_rollover }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutIndirectRollover -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_indirect_rollover }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutTaxableAmountNotDetermined -- fired: form1099_r_knockouts.ko_knockout_taxable_amount_not_determined }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.SocialSecurityBenefitsAreLossGreaterThan3k -- fired: social_security_knockouts.ko_social_security_repayment_over_3k }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutPaidEstimatedTaxesUnderDifferentLastName -- fired: estimated_payments_knockouts.ko_knockout_paid_estimated_taxes_under_different_last_name }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutNoPaymentsHsaDistribution -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_no_payments_hsa_distribution }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHsaMedicalSavingsAccountType -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_medical_savings_account_type }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHsaDistributionCode -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_distribution_code }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutOtherCoveragePartOfYear -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_other_coverage_part_of_year }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutOtherCoverageWholeYear -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_other_coverage_whole_year }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutEarningsOnExcessContributions -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_earnings_on_excess_contributions }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHsaTestingPeriodAdditionalIncomeYes -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_testing_period_additional_income_yes }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHsaUnqualifiedDistributions -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_unqualified_distributions }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHsaDistributionFMV -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_distribution_fmv }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutMaritalChangeAffectsContributionLimit -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_marital_change_affects_contribution_limit }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutMFSLine6Check -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_mfs_line6_check }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowHsaContributionsOverLimitKnockout -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_contributions_over_limit }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHsaExcessContributions -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_excess_contributions }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutContributionSummaryNoneAllowed -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_contribution_summary_none_allowed }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHdhpCoverageStatusNotNeeded -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hdhp_coverage_status_not_needed }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutNotEnrolledInHdhp -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_not_enrolled_in_hdhp }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutMadeQualifiedHsaFundingDistribution -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_made_qualified_hsa_funding_distribution }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHsaCoverage -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_coverage }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutFilerIsDependentAndContributesToHsa -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_filer_is_dependent_and_contributes_to_hsa }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.ExtraHsaDistributionsWithoutActivity -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_has_hsa_distributions_without_activity }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.ExtraHsaDistributionsSecondaryFilerWithoutMfj -- fired: hsa_knockouts.ko_hsa_distributions_secondary_filer_used_without_mfj }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.IncomeSourcesNotSupported -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_income_sources_not_supported }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.NotDigitalAssets -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_not_digital_assets }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.HasForeignAccountsOrTrusts -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_has_foreign_accounts_or_trusts }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.MadeIraContributions -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_made_ira_contributions }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutBox15IncomeFromDifferentState -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_box15_income_from_different_state }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.HasABox14NYRRTAValueWeKnockout -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_has_a_box14_nyrrta_value_we_knockout }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutHasRRTACodesInBox14NotInNY -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_has_rrta_codes_in_box14_not_in_ny }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutYonkersPartYear -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_knockout_yonkers_part_year }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.FlowKnockoutUnsupportedState -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_flow_knockout_unsupported_state }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.IsTooLateToFileOrResubmit -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_is_too_late_to_file_or_resubmit }
    ; KnockoutEntry { -- reason: KnockoutReason.KnockoutHasNoPaymentsOrCredits -- fired: local_knockouts.ko_knockout_has_no_payments_or_credits }
  ]
  definition fired_knockouts equals
    map each e among (list of e among knockout_table such that e.fired) to e.reason
```
